                    <hi rendition="#italic">Post</hi>, <ref target="#pg580">p. 580</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d264-f2" n="44" xml:id="d264-f2-content">
                <p>W. Averell Harriman, American Ambassador in the Soviet Union.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d264-f3" n="45" xml:id="d264-f3-content">
                <p>Vyacheslav Mikhailovich Molotov, Soviet People’s Commissar for Foreign
                    Affairs.</p>
            </note>
